<h2>Choose Us for Your Next Clinical Trial or Research Study</h2>
<p>Partnering with our Center gives sponsors access to expertise, infrastructure, and patient populations that make clinical trials efficient, reliable, and impactful. Here’s what sets us apart:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Experienced Team</strong> – Core Faculty and research staff with national and international trial leadership experience.
Regulatory & Operational Expertise – Full support with study design, regulatory submissions, IRB coordination, and site management.</li>
<li><strong>Access to Diverse Populations</strong> – Reach South Texas communities, including underserved and high-burden populations, for rapid recruitment and meaningful outcomes.</li>
<li><strong>Comprehensive Trial Capabilities</strong> – Inpatient and outpatient trials, vaccine studies, longitudinal research, and behavioral interventions.</li>
<li><strong>Commitment to Quality & Ethics</strong> – High standards for safety, data integrity, and ethical research practices.
<li><strong>Community Engagement</strong> – Strong partnerships with local communities enhance participant recruitment, retention, and study impact.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Past Successes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Leadership in international COVID-19 therapeutic trials that informed Long COVID treatment strategies.</li>
<li>Pioneering HIV vaccine studies and behavioral intervention research.</li>
<li>Successful completion of multiple inpatient and outpatient clinical trials with diverse patient populations.</li>
<li>Strong record of publications and presentations highlighting research impact locally, nationally, and globally.</li></ul>
